mpleted":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"https://packagist.org/packages/symplify/rule-doc-generator\n\n+---------------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Abandoned Package                     | Suggested Replacement                                                            |\n+---------------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| symplify/rule-doc-generator-contracts | none                                                                             |\n+---------------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/driftingly/rector-laravel/issues/574/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/driftingly/rector-laravel/issues/574/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/driftingly/rector-laravel/issues/478","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/driftingly/rector-laravel","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/driftingly/rector-laravel/issues/478/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/driftingly/rector-laravel/issues/478/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/driftingly/rector-laravel/issues/478/events","html_url":"https://github.com/driftingly/rector-laravel/issues/478","id":4030204913,"node_id":"I_kwDOFNE1eM7wOAvx","number":478,"title":"[Bug] 2.1.10 New Volt rector throws InvalidArgumentException","user":{"login":"billypoke","id":2739965,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3Mzk5NjU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2739965?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/billypoke","html_url":"https://github.com/billypoke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billypoke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billypoke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billypoke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billypoke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billypoke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billypoke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billypoke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billypoke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billypoke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-03-05T19:39:29Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T12:33:54Z","closed_at":"2026-03-09T12:33:54Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"#463 causes the following error in RenameClassRector (rector 2.3.8, rector-laravel 2.1.10). I confirmed this with `webmozart/assert` 1 and 2, which was added in this release.\n```php\npublic function configure(array $configuration): void\n{\n    Assert::allString($configuration);\n    Assert::allString(array_keys($configuration)); // <-- This line\n    $this->renamedClassesDataCollector->addOldToNewClasses($configuration);\n}\n```\n`$configuration` contains:\n```\narray:44 [\n  \"App\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\App\"\n  \"Arr\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Arr\"\n  \"Artisan\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Artisan\"\n  \"Auth\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Auth\"\n  \"Blade\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Blade\"\n  \"Broadcast\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Broadcast\"\n  \"Bus\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Bus\"\n  \"Cache\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Cache\"\n  \"Config\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Config\"\n  \"Context\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Context\"\n  \"Cookie\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Cookie\"\n  \"Crypt\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Crypt\"\n  \"Date\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Date\"\n  \"DB\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\DB\"\n  \"Eloquent\" => \"Illuminate\\Database\\Eloquent\\Model\"\n  \"Event\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Event\"\n  \"File\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\File\"\n  \"Gate\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Gate\"\n  \"Hash\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Hash\"\n  \"Http\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Http\"\n  \"Js\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Js\"\n  \"Lang\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Lang\"\n  \"Log\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Log\"\n  \"Mail\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Mail\"\n  \"Notification\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Notification\"\n  \"Number\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Number\"\n  \"Password\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Password\"\n  \"Process\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Process\"\n  \"Queue\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Queue\"\n  \"RateLimiter\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\RateLimiter\"\n  \"Redirect\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Redirect\"\n  \"Request\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Request\"\n  \"Response\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Response\"\n  \"Route\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Route\"\n  \"Schema\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Schema\"\n  \"Session\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Session\"\n  \"Storage\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Storage\"\n  \"Str\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Str\"\n  \"URL\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\URL\"\n  \"Validator\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Validator\"\n  \"View\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\View\"\n  \"Vite\" => \"Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Vite\"\n  0 => \"Livewire\\Volt\\Component\"\n  1 => \"Livewire\\Component\"\n]\n```\n\n## Diagnostic Info:\n\n### `rector.php`\n\n```php\n<?php\n\ndeclare(strict_types=1);\n\nuse Rector\\Caching\\ValueObject\\Storage\\FileCacheStorage;\nuse Rector\\Config\\RectorConfig;\nuse Rector\\DeadCode\\Rector\\ClassMethod\\RemoveUnusedPromotedPropertyRector;\nuse Rector\\DeadCode\\Rector\\Plus\\RemoveDeadZeroAndOneOperationRector;\nuse Rector\\Php81\\Rector\\FuncCall\\NullToStrictStringFuncCallArgRector;\nuse Rector\\Php83\\Rector\\ClassMethod\\AddOverrideAttributeToOverriddenMethodsRector;\nuse RectorLaravel\\Rector\\Class_\\AddHasFactoryToModelsRector;\nuse RectorLaravel\\Rector\\FuncCall\\AppToResolveRector;\nuse RectorLaravel\\Rector\\StaticCall\\CarbonToDateFacadeRector;\nuse RectorLaravel\\Set\\LaravelSetList;\nuse RectorLaravel\\Set\\LaravelSetProvider;\n\nreturn RectorConfig::configure()\n    ->withCache(\n        cacheDirectory: '/tmp/rector',\n        cacheClass: FileCacheStorage::class,\n    )\n    ->withPaths([\n        __DIR__.'/app',\n        __DIR__.'/bootstrap/app.php',\n        __DIR__.'/config',\n        __DIR__.'/database',\n        __DIR__.'/modules',\n        __DIR__.'/public',\n        __DIR__.'/resources',\n    ])\n    ->withPhpSets()\n    ->withComposerBased(\n        phpunit: true,\n        laravel: true,\n    )\n    ->withSetProviders(LaravelSetProvider::class)\n    ->withAttributesSets()\n    ->withPreparedSets(\n        deadCode: true,\n        codeQuality: true,\n        typeDeclarations: true,\n        privatization: true,\n        earlyReturn: true,\n    )\n    ->withSets([\n        LaravelSetList::LARAVEL_ARRAYACCESS_TO_METHOD_CALL,\n        LaravelSetList::LARAVEL_ARRAY_STR_FUNCTION_TO_STATIC_CALL,\n        LaravelSetList::LARAVEL_CODE_QUALITY,\n        LaravelSetList::LARAVEL_COLLECTION,\n        LaravelSetList::LARAVEL_CONTAINER_STRING_TO_FULLY_QUALIFIED_NAME,\n        LaravelSetList::LARAVEL_ELOQUENT_MAGIC_METHOD_TO_QUERY_BUILDER,\n        LaravelSetList::LARAVEL_FACADE_ALIASES_TO_FULL_NAMES,\n        LaravelSetList::LARAVEL_FACTORIES,\n        LaravelSetList::LARAVEL_IF_HELPERS,\n        LaravelSetList::LARAVEL_LEGACY_FACTORIES_TO_CLASSES,\n    ])\n    ->withSkip([\n        AddOverrideAttributeToOverriddenMethodsRector::class,\n        RemoveDeadZeroAndOneOperationRector::class,\n        RemoveUnusedPromotedPropertyRector::class,\n        NullToStrictStringFuncCallArgRector::class,\n        CarbonToDateFacadeRector::class,\n        AddHasFactoryToModelsRector::class,\n        AppToResolveRector::class,\n    ]);\n```\n### rector/rector info\n```sh\ncomposer show rector/rector\nname     : rector/rector\ndescrip. : Instant Upgrade and Automated Refactoring of any PHP code\nkeywords : automation, dev, migration, refactoring\nversions : * 2.3.8\nreleased : 2026-02-22, last week\ntype     : library\nlicense  : MIT License (MIT) (OSI approved) https://spdx.org/licenses/MIT.html#licenseText\nhomepage : https://getrector.com/\nsource   : [git] https://github.com/rectorphp/rector.git bbd37aedd8df749916cffa2a947cfc4714d1ba2c\ndist     : [zip] https://api.github.com/repos/rectorphp/rector/zipball/bbd37aedd8df749916cffa2a947cfc4714d1ba2c bbd37aedd8df749916cffa2a947cfc4714d1ba2c\npath     : /Users/ransompate/development/propper/vendor/rector/rector\nnames    : rector/rector\n\nsupport\nissues : https://github.com/rectorphp/rector/issues\nsource : https://github.com/rectorphp/rector/tree/2.3.8\n\nautoload\nfiles\n\nrequires\nphp ^7.4|^8.0\nphpstan/phpstan ^2.1.38\n\nsuggests\next-dom To manipulate phpunit.xml via the custom-rule command\n\nconflicts\nrector/rector-doctrine *\nrector/rector-downgrade-php *\nrector/rector-phpunit *\nrector/rector-symfony *\n```\n### rector-laravel info\n```sh\ncomposer show driftingly/rector-laravel\nname     : driftingly/rector-laravel\ndescrip. : Rector upgrades rules for Laravel Framework\nkeywords :\nversions : * 2.1.10\nreleased : 2026-03-03, this week\ntype     : rector-extension\nlicense  : MIT License (MIT) (OSI approved) https://spdx.org/licenses/MIT.html#licenseText\nhomepage :\nsource   : [git] https://github.com/driftingly/rector-laravel.git 8f90418f1f17e29852a54791fd859547b23f00f4\ndist     : [zip] https://api.github.com/repos/driftingly/rector-laravel/zipball/8f90418f1f17e29852a54791fd859547b23f00f4 8f90418f1f17e29852a54791fd859547b23f00f4\npath     : /Users/ransompate/development/propper/vendor/driftingly/rector-laravel\nnames    : driftingly/rector-laravel\n\nsupport\nissues : https://github.com/driftingly/rector-laravel/issues\nsource : https://github.com/driftingly/rector-laravel/tree/2.1.10\n\nautoload\npsr-4\nRectorLaravel\\ => src\n\nrequires\nphp >=8.3\nrector/rector ^2.3.0\nsymplify/rule-doc-generator-contracts ^11.2\nwebmozart/assert ^1.11 || ^2.0\n\nrequires (dev)\nnette/utils ^4.0\nnikic/php-parser ^5.6\nphpstan/extension-installer ^1.3\nphpstan/phpstan ^2.0\nphpstan/phpstan-deprecation-rules ^2.0\nphpstan/phpstan-strict-rules ^2.0\nphpstan/phpstan-webmozart-assert ^2.0\nphpunit/phpunit ^10.5\nsymplify/rule-doc-generator ^12.2\ntightenco/duster ^3.1\ntracy/tracy ^2.10\n```","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/driftingly/rector-laravel/issues/478/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/driftingly/rector-laravel/issues/478/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}